A '''Stone Grimace''' is an invincible stationary statue with the shape of a head with a wide-open mouth and hollow eyes. Stone Grimaces will sporadically spit a Red bullet in Isaac's direction until the room is cleared by killing regular enemies, or by pressing {{E|Pressure Plate}}s. When the room is cleared, the Stone Grimace closes its eyes and mouth.

