=== Stone Eye ===
{{infobox monster
 | name        = Stone Eye
 | id          = 201
 | environment = {{floor|Womb}}{{floor|Utero}}{{floor|Scarred Womb}}<br>{{floor|Sheol}}
 | behavior    = Stationary and invulnerable monster that constantly rotates and fires a flickering Technology laser. Stops firing when the room is cleared.
