The '''Quake Grimace''' fires a line of rocks in one direction upon landing every 3 seconds. In most cases, even after the room is cleared of vulnerable enemies, they will continue this behavior. However, they can be deactivated from {{E|Pressure Plate}}s.

If a {{R|Secret Room}} or a {{R|Super Secret Room}} is placed in the path of their attack, the attack will break the wall and open the entrance.
{{dlc clear}}{{clear}}

== Notes ==
* These monsters are impassable, even with flight.
* These monsters can be destroyed using {{p|Chaos Card}}, {{i|Little Horn}} and {{i|Euthanasia}}, though they will respawn upon leaving and re-entering the room they were in.
* With {{i|Infestation 2}}, killing Stone Grimaces creates a [[Blue Spider]], allowing blue spiders to be farmed by leaving and re-entering the room.
* {{i|Fire Mind}} tears that hit these monsters can still cause explosions.
* {{dlc|a}} Hitting Grimaces increases the {{i|Dead Eye|n}} damage multiplier.
* {{dlc|a+}} If an uncleared room has Cross Grimaces, leaving and then re-entering the room by bombing a door will make them stop shooting, making the room easier.
* {{dlc|r}} 4 Stone Grimaces can appear in {{e|Loki}}'s boss fight.

